stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Buffering
  Buffering --> Running : valid 4-command window
  Buffering --> Faulted : startup safety failure
  Running --> Holding : temporary underrun
  Running --> Faulted : terminal safety failure
  Holding --> Running : valid successor
  Holding --> Faulted : watchdog or validation failure
  Faulted --> Faulted
  Faulted --> [*] : shutdown after telemetry drain
